# Public repo safety - files with PII or project-specific config
# These are excluded before making the repo public. To re-include a file,
# first sanitize it (replace real emails/UUIDs with placeholders, or
# replace project refs with env var instructions), then remove from this list.
#
# .mcp.json — contains Supabase project ref (yxupftplzbhukhxhongf). Not a secret
#   on its own, but exposes which project this code targets. To re-include:
#   document that forks must set their own project ref, or switch to an env var.
.mcp.json
#
# docs/TESTING_BOOKINGS.md — contains admin account email and UUID used for
#   booking tests. To re-include: replace both with generic placeholders like
#   YOUR_ADMIN_EMAIL and YOUR_ADMIN_USER_ID.
docs/TESTING_BOOKINGS.md
#
# docs/plans/SPRINT_1.1.md and SPRINT_1.5.md — internal sprint planning docs
#   with personal email and admin UUID embedded in testing instructions.
#   To re-include: replace personal identifiers with placeholders.
docs/plans/SPRINT_1.1.md
docs/plans/SPRINT_1.5.md